5. PAGE 3: DIODE LAB (#diode)
=====================================================

Layout: main column and sidebar.

Top: tab buttons (above the layout, with 20px bottom margin): "1 · Thermal voltage", "2 · Ideal switch", "3 · Ideal vs. actual", "4 · Breakdown".

Main column:
